//--------------------------------------
// monograms

glyph monogram-(p|n|m) 16 16
ref (yang|yin|ren) 3 7

map ⚊|⚋|𝌀 = monogram-(p|n|m)

//--------------------------------------
// digrams

glyph digram-(p|n|m)(p*3|n*3|m*3) 16 16
ref (yang|yin|ren) 3 5
ref (yang*3|yin*3|ren*3) 3 9

map ⚌|⚍|𝌃|⚎|⚏|𝌄|𝌁|𝌂|𝌅 = digram-(p|n|m)(p*3|n*3|m*3)

//--------------------------------------
// trigrams

glyph trigram-(p|n)(p*2|n*2)(p*4|n*4) 16 16
ref (yang|yin) 3 4
ref (yang*2|yin*2) 3 7
ref (yang*4|yin*4) 3 10

map ☰|☱|☲|☳|☴|☵|☶|☷ = trigram-(p|n)(p*2|n*2)(p*4|n*4)

//--------------------------------------
// tetragrams

glyph tetragram-(p|n|m)(p*3|n*3|m*3)(p*9|n*9|m*9)(p*27|n*27|m*27) 16 16
ref (yang*27|yin*27|ren*27) 3 2
ref (yang*9|yin*9|ren*9) 3 5
ref (yang*3|yin*3|ren*3) 3 8
ref (yang|yin|ren) 3 11

map U+1D306..1D356 = tetragram-(p|n|m)(p*3|n*3|m*3)(p*9|n*9|m*9)(p*27|n*27|m*27)

//--------------------------------------
// hexagrams

glyph hexagram-(p|n)(p*2|n*2)(p*4|n*4)(p*8|n*8)(p*16|n*16)(p*32|n*32) 16 16
ref (yang|yin)-sm 3 2
ref (yang*2|yin*2)-sm 3 4
ref (yang*4|yin*4)-sm 3 6
ref (yang*8|yin*8)-sm 3 8
ref (yang*16|yin*16)-sm 3 10
ref (yang*32|yin*32)-sm 3 12

// I seriously hate the King Wen order.
map ䷀|䷪|䷍|䷡|䷈|䷄|䷙|䷊|䷉|䷹|䷥|䷵|䷼|䷻|䷨|䷒|䷌|䷰|䷝|䷶|䷤|䷾|䷕|䷣|䷘|䷐|䷔|䷲|䷩|䷂|䷚|䷗ = hexagram-(p|n)(p*2|n*2)(p*4|n*4)(p*8|n*8)(p*16|n*16)p
map ䷫|䷛|䷱|䷟|䷸|䷯|䷑|䷭|䷅|䷮|䷿|䷧|䷺|䷜|䷃|䷆|䷠|䷞|䷷|䷽|䷴|䷦|䷳|䷎|䷋|䷬|䷢|䷏|䷓|䷇|䷖|䷁ = hexagram-(p|n)(p*2|n*2)(p*4|n*4)(p*8|n*8)(p*16|n*16)n

